This is a nice idea, but the harsh lighting and resultant lack of shadows makes the image appear flat. A slightly different angle might also have added depth.</td>', 'This is a nice idea, but the harsh lighting and resultant lack of shadows makes the image appear flat. A slightly different angle might also have added depth.', '2026-02-22 14:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7810525, 1304309, 5628, '<td valign="top">
This is a very busy image. It is hard for the viewer to decide where to focus. The leading lines of the counter and table help a little, but the image would have benefitted from a blurred foreground, leading into a focal point in the back (or vice versa, depending on where you wanted the main focus to be).</td>', 'This is a very busy image. It is hard for the viewer to decide where to focus. The leading lines of the counter and table help a little, but the image would have benefitted from a blurred foreground, leading into a focal point in the back (or vice versa, depending on where you wanted the main focus to be).', '2026-02-22 14:04:41.000000', NULL, 1),
